{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c355","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a182c7-1fa3-7740-b1c6-efc1a8b254a1"},"sequence":5,"recorded_at":1780531400000005,"record_type":"status","durability":"ephemeral","causation_id":"01a182c7-21ae-7563-b8aa-8495f4c7e6b2","payload_type":"turn.input.user","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"command_id":"01a182c7-21ae-7563-b8aa-8495f4c7e6b2","kind":"turn_input_user","prompt":"Task 21 fix round on branch daily-cap (this worktree, builds on the last commit). Same rules: no `next start`/`next dev`, no secrets, no .env files, no `npm run build:book`, small diff, stay in core/, server/images/, their tests, docs/contracts.md. Also check the size hook limits (docs/contracts.md must stay under 20 KB).\n\nChanges:\n1. Default DAILY_SPEND_CAP_USD becomes 2 (env.ts, tests, docs).\n2. Copy: no \"come back tomorrow\". Replace MSG_BUDGET_TOTAL and MSG_BUDGET_DAILY with ONE shared constant in core/images.ts, MSG_CREDITS_OUT = \"So many people loved this that we've run out of credits to share. Feel free to bring your own key! Meanwhile, The Wonderful Wizard of Oz is ready to read, with its soundtrack and illustrations.\" Both codes `budget` and `daily_budget` return it. Also export `CREDITS_OUT_LIBRARY_HREF = \"/\"` (the reader/library route) so the UI can link the Oz sentence; do not edit UI files (other PRs own them). Update tests and docs/contracts.md accordingly (document the constant and the href for UI).\n3. Per-person limit hook for free uploaded-book processing (no route, no wiring): in server/images/quota.ts or a new small server/quota/books.ts reusing hashIp and the same pattern as image quotas, export FREE_BOOKS_PER_PERSON = 1 and a function that reserves one free book for a person keyed on hashed IP and anon cookie id (UTC-free, i.e. for the whole hackathon, key TTL ~10 days), blocking when either key is over the limit, plus a refund function. Tests: first book ok, second blocked by same IP with new cookie, blocked by same cookie with new IP, refund allows retry. Document briefly in docs/contracts.md.\nRun `npx vitest run` and `npx tsc --noEmit`; both must pass. Commit \"Share the credits-out message, default daily cap 2, free-book quota hook\" with trailer:\nCo-authored-by: Muse Code (Meta) <muse-code@agents.noreply.invalid>","run_stream":{"id":"01a182c7-21ae-7563-b8aa-8495f4c7e6b2","kind":"run"}}}
