{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c8ab","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a182c7-1fa3-7740-b1c6-efc1a8b254a1"},"sequence":688,"recorded_at":1780531400001371,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"01a182c7-21ae-7563-b8aa-8495f4c7e6b2","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"command_id":"01a182c7-21ae-7563-b8aa-8495f4c7e6b2","event":{"chunk":"edited\nchanged lines: lines 321-332\n--- original\n+++ updated\n@@\n-A Redis lock per key returns `pending` to concurrent requests. Quota is\n-5 new images per person per day by hashed IP and signed cookie,\n-whichever runs out first; a shared spend counter in integer\n-micro-dollars sits under `SPEND_CAP_USD` (default 10), plus a daily\n-counter per UTC day under `DAILY_SPEND_CAP_USD` (default 2, 48 h key\n-TTL, resets on UTC rollover). Failures refund quota and both counters\n-and release the lock. Both caps apply only to requests paid with our\n-key; a future bring-your-own-key path skips them. Free book uploads\n-allow `FREE_BOOKS_PER_PERSON` (1) per person for the hackathon, keyed\n-by hashed IP and anon cookie with no day and a ~10-day TTL\n-(`checkBookQuota`/`refundBookQuota` in `server/images/quota.ts`, no\n-route yet).\n+Quota is 5 new images per person per day by hashed IP and signed\n+cookie, whichever runs out first; a shared spend counter in integer\n+micro-dollars sits under `SPEND_CAP_USD` (default 10), plus a daily\n+counter per UTC day under `DAILY_SPEND_CAP_USD` (default 2, 48 h key\n+TTL). Failures refund quota and both counters and release the lock.\n+Both caps apply only to requests paid with our key; a future\n+bring-your-own-key path skips them. Free uploads allow one book per\n+person (`FREE_BOOKS_PER_PERSON` = 1, hashed IP plus anon cookie, no\n+day, ~10-day TTL; `checkBookQuota`/`refundBookQuota` in\n+`server/images/quota.ts`, no route yet).\n","final_result":true,"kind":"output","task_id":"01a182c9-78ae-70f1-a156-970ac3d67565"},"kind":"task_lifecycle","run_stream":{"id":"01a182c7-21ae-7563-b8aa-8495f4c7e6b2","kind":"run"},"task_id":"01a182c9-78ae-70f1-a156-970ac3d67565","task_stream":{"id":"01a182c9-78ae-70f1-a156-970ac3d67565","kind":"task"}}}
